Module 06 – SEO Growth, Promotion & Conversion Optimization

1. Introduction

This report summarizes the SEO research, competitor analysis, conversion rate optimization audit, and promotional activities prepared as part of the Codomax Digital Marketing Internship.

Official Website: https://codomaxdigital.in/
Internship Page: https://codomaxdigital.in/internship

2. Keyword Research

High-intent keyword research was conducted to identify search phrases that students may use when looking for internships, certificates, and technology training.

Main Keyword Categories

Free virtual internships

Online internships for students

Internship with certificates

Project-based internships

Online technology training

Beginner-friendly technical courses

A keyword research document containing primary keywords, long-tail keywords, and suggested blog topics was prepared and uploaded.

File: Keyword-Research/High-Intent-SEO-Keywords.md

Search volumes and keyword rankings were not independently measured.

3. Competitor Analysis

Four competing internship and training platforms were selected for a qualitative comparison:

Internshala

AICTE National Internship Portal

Unstop

LetsIntern

The analysis reviewed their target audiences, keyword themes, content strategies, and registration journeys.

File: Competitor-Analysis/Competitor-SEO-Analysis.md

Backlink counts, referring domains, and exact keyword rankings were not independently measured.

4. Conversion Rate Optimization Audit

The Codomax internship page was reviewed to identify possible improvements in:

Headline clarity

Call-to-action placement

Trust signals

