8. Key Recommendations

Based on the research and audit, the following actions are recommended:

Publish SEO-focused articles regularly.

Target relevant long-tail internship keywords.

Build backlinks through genuine outreach and quality guest posts.

Submit accurate business profiles to relevant directories.

Promote internship opportunities through student communities.

Improve the visibility and clarity of registration CTAs.

Display transparent certificate and eligibility information.

Monitor website traffic and registration conversions using analytics tools.

9. Conclusion

Module 06 focused on strengthening SEO research, understanding competitor strategies, and identifying opportunities to improve the Codomax internship registration page.

The research documents, competitor comparison, CRO audit, and growth recommendations provide a foundation for future digital marketing activities.

Further implementation and performance tracking will be required to measure actual improvements in website traffic, backlinks, campaign engagement, and student registrations.

